Browser websocket endpoint which can be used as an argument to *note
puppeteer.connect: #puppeteerconnectoptions.  The format is
‘ws://${host}:${port}/devtools/browser/<id>’

You can find the ‘webSocketDebuggerUrl’ from
‘http://${host}:${port}/json/version’.  Learn more about the devtools
protocol (https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol) and the
browser endpoint
(https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/#how-do-i-access-the-browser-target).


