1.9.63 page.setDefaultNavigationTimeout(timeout)
------------------------------------------------

   • ‘timeout’ <number
     (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#Number_type)>
     Maximum navigation time in milliseconds

This setting will change the default maximum navigation time for the
following methods and related shortcuts: - *note page.goBack([options]):
#pagegobackoptions. - *note page.goForward([options]):
#pagegoforwardoptions. - *note page.goto(url[: #pagegotourl-options. -
*note page.reload([options]): #pagereloadoptions. - *note
page.setContent(html[: #pagesetcontenthtml-options. - *note
page.waitForNavigation([options]): #pagewaitfornavigationoptions.

     *NOTE* *note ‘page.setDefaultNavigationTimeout’:
     #pagesetdefaultnavigationtimeouttimeout. takes priority over *note
     ‘page.setDefaultTimeout’: #pagesetdefaulttimeouttimeout.


