1.9.87 page.workers()
---------------------

   • returns: <Array
     (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array)<*note
     Worker: #class-worker.>> This method returns all of the dedicated
     WebWorkers
     (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API)
     associated with the page.

     *NOTE* This does not contain ServiceWorkers


