1.15 class: Tracing
===================

You can use *note ‘tracing.start’: #tracingstartoptions. and *note
‘tracing.stop’: #tracingstop. to create a trace file which can be opened
in Chrome DevTools or timeline viewer
(https://chromedevtools.github.io/timeline-viewer/).

await page.tracing.start({path: 'trace.json'});
await page.goto('https://www.google.com');
await page.tracing.stop();

* Menu:

* tracing.start::
* tracing.stop::


