     (https://nodejs.org/api/buffer.html#buffer_class_buffer)>> Promise
     which resolves to buffer or a base64 string (depending on the value
     of ‘options.encoding’) with captured screenshot.

This method scrolls element into view if needed, and then uses *note
page.screenshot: #pagescreenshotoptions. to take a screenshot of the
element.  If the element is detached from DOM, the method throws an
error.


File: puppeteer.info,  Node: elementHandle.tap,  Next: elementHandle.toString,  Prev: elementHandle.screenshot,  Up: class ElementHandle

