     (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise)>
     Promise which resolves when the element is successfully tapped.
     Promise gets rejected if the element is detached from DOM.

This method scrolls element into view if needed, and then uses *note
touchscreen.tap: #touchscreentapx-y. to tap in the center of the
element.  If the element is detached from DOM, the method throws an
