----------------------

   • returns: <?*note Frame: #class-frame.> A *note Frame: #class-frame.
     that initiated this request, or ‘null’ if navigating to error
     pages.


File: puppeteer.info,  Node: request.headers,  Next: request.isNavigationRequest,  Prev: request.frame,  Up: class Request

